{"baseRefOid":"dc792f12b1c8e0c448ddb0bfb21d1e70faec33c7","body":"The previous critical-exponent result left an intermediate budget range unresolved. This revision integrates the analytically audited exact boundary B*=2^(1/s), including equality and collapsing families with any prescribed fixed floor below one. It retains the earlier quantitative bounds and all prior manuscript versions.\n\nSource theorem: 49705281f05ab18b71bd9ebc2da1985a0433340c (PR244, unchanged G1-G7 accepted after a documented usage interruption and resumed review). Manuscript head: 6f9b27f59e3b105a872c773ed4d38d027536655b. Exact manuscript UTF-8/LF SHA256: 6b0c330c283e4f40d1711f4c2e358fdb3edf2ed73d70ac5fb87a55ca96514c64. The package binds 172 source inputs and preserves the full source-review history plus artifact-specific prior-PDF assessment and schema correction.\n\nAdds the close classical sign-region precedent and updates the Aida access statement. No external priority, optimal positive-gap value, boundary rate, physical mass gap or independent peer review is claimed. Integrated manuscript audit, owned-Colab PDF reproduction, visual QA and its first exact-PDF assessment remain pending; no previous rating transfers.","files":[{"path":"papers/marginal-transfer/PACKAGE-BOUNDARY299.txt","additions":15,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"papers/marginal-transfer/SOURCE-INPUTS299.json","additions":867,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"papers/marginal-transfer/critical299-section.tex","additions":183,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"papers/marginal-transfer/evidence299/critical299A.txt","additions":115,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"papers/marginal-transfer/evidence299/judges299.txt","additions":22,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"papers/marginal-transfer/evidence299/parent-source299-acceptance.json","additions":20,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"papers/marginal-transfer/evidence299/prior298-assessment/full-scientific-report.tx